     "titulo": "Separating the voice of the outlet and the source",
     "texto": [
      "**Ifølge arrangøren** attributes information to the organiser; it doesn't mean the newsroom has verified it independently. Identify who is speaking, what information they give and what is missing to understand the context."
     ],
